+/* The default path's first tuple changed: the connection now sends to that
+ * tuple's address with its remote connection ID. Register that pair, so a
+ * stateless reset arriving from that address with that connection ID's
+ * token is recognized (RFC 9000 section 10.3.1). Only a connection that has
